<title>RUSSIA: Rouble firms to 3,580 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble firms to 3,580 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble rose to 3,580.00 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,589.50 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 24		  Oct 23</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,580.00		3,589.50</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    3.85		    3.04</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
